"entity": {
"name": "Arkema SA",
"description": "Arkema SA engages in manufacturing and supplying chemical products. Advanced Materials, Adhesive Solutions, Coating Solutions, Primary Materials, and Corporate. The Advanced Materials segment offers innovative solutions with high added value to meet the major challenges of sustainable development, including lightweighting, new energies, access to water, bio-based products, and recycling. The Adhesive Solutions segment supplies technologies used in building activities for businesses and individuals, including sealants, tile and flooring adhesives and waterproofing systems, and technologies. The Coating Solutions segment focuses on the broad range of innovative products for decorative paints, industrial coatings and adhesives, and provides solutions for applications in the paper industry, superabsorbent, and water treatment. The Primary Materials segment includes businesses of global acrylic monomers, legacy refrigerants, and hydrogen peroxide. The company was founded by Thierry le H\u00e9naff on January 31, 2003 and is headquartered in Puteaux, France.",
